  dialogues:
  - name: Leaifa
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9d7b3aba127390f4092ce7e668c7114b, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - Shit! Drone incoming!
  - name: Rautia
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: aa28b24cb0c23874d91590d7d9051a37, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - 'Woah, I have not seen one up and running this close before. '
    - They are going to keep charging at us with their big saws!
  - name: Denali
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37666a48d1d431849a0bbda42fd7b28e, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "Let\u2019s take it down."
    - Rautia, you attack from range.
    - Leaifa, you attack them up close with me.
  - name: Tutorial
    portrait: {fileID: -583743315, guid: 9eb1f13c449026d43b777a12a3cc6f75, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - 'Combat is turnbased.

      Select each character and choose their actions.'
    - 'Choose selected characters'' actions by: left-clicking on the ground to move,
      or on an enemy to attack.'
    - You can do the same action several times as long as you have AP for it.
    - Press the Ready button to execute your turn.
    - Characters can only do so much each turn!
